OL,3,GNEWSAFixing air links an 'obsession'   
OL,4,Afor politician                         
OL,6,FA re-elected politician has said he is 
OL,7,F"obsessed" with fixing an island's air 
OL,8,Flinks after multiple flights were      
OL,9,Fcancelled on election day.             
OL,11,FSteve Roberts, who won one of the five 
OL,12,Favailable seats in the States of       
OL,13,FAlderney on Saturday, said he was "not 
OL,14,Fsurprised" by the cancellations as he  
OL,15,Ffelt services to the island had got    
OL,16,F"worse and worse".                     
OL,18,FHe added he was concerned cancellations
OL,19,Fcould present a "very real" risk to    
OL,20,Flife if hospital appointments were     
OL,21,Fmissed.                                
