OL,3,GNEWSAFixing air links an 'obsession'   
OL,4,Afor politician                         
OL,6,FAurigny said the cancellations were due
OL,7,Fto a mixture of technical and          
OL,8,Fweather-related issues and acknowledged
OL,9,Fthe services had "fallen well short of 
OL,10,Fexpectations in recent months".        
